      "edition": "Git 2.56.1 current release, checked 2026-11-20",
      "items": [
        "Use current Git 2.56.1 documentation as the baseline. Git 2.56 added `git add --resolved`, which stages only resolved unmerged paths after checking for remaining conflict markers, and `git branch --delete-merged` for guarded bulk cleanup of branches merged to matching upstreams. Git 2.54 introduced the experimental `git history` helper; 2.56 adds its `drop` subcommand, which remains experimental and has merge-history limitations. Check `git --version` because installed builds and command availability vary."
